Deployment ladder

1. Corpus: add this seed and link it from the compiler index; label it proposed until its schema and operators are bound.
2. Practice: run the Open-Slot Reconstruction Assay on a small source-grounded sample and retain blind ratings and failures.
3. Runtime: implement typed slot/evidence objects, branch-preserving updates, selective fusion, provenance, abstention, and audit output; verify each against the benchmark.

Do not claim the runtime exists because this specification exists. Promote each layer only when its own evidence is present.

